{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "对人民日报理论工作的批评（一九六四年四月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n075)\n对人民日报理论工作的批评\n（一九六四年四月）\n《人民日报》的理论工作是应付我的，谁管理论版？（答：陈浚）让王若水管好了，他的文章多吗？\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-743e785fee5f76135722", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-075.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "8387fdf8ee2af015b4220e94060782bca58d1c1cae721fba87fca97da2695eb1", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "1569351a1d247d07aee20a3e1b2eae1236a6b9696169c93b6951734053106fc5", "text_chars": 143}
